Package: com.lucas.glassx
Name: GlassX
Version: 3.1.0~beta2
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: GlassX 3.1 Beta 2 for X 12.38 build 24. Keeps the validated native Liquid Glass pre-TabBar engine, NeoFreeBird Appearance integration, Lucas25Pedrosa credit, multilingual UI and Tab Bar Tint modes. Secondary Liquid Glass switches remain enabled, but runtime hooks are restricted to exact LiquidGlassRedesignFeatures and ChatFeatureSwitchesImpl classes to avoid selector collisions with unrelated X features. Grok hook is withheld until its owning class is verified.
